Then, within the stated weak-coupling compactified regimes,
\[
o:=(o_{\rm QM},o_{\rm 2d})\in \Sigma_{\rm QM}\times\Sigma_{\rm 2d},
\]
where $\Sigma_{\rm QM}$ is the success set for quantum-mechanical monopole-vortex continuity and $\Sigma_{\rm 2d}$ is the success set for monopole-to-vortex EFT reduction and flux fractionalization.

\noindent\textbf{Premises.}
\[
