\mathrm{(P1)}&\quad \Sigma_{\rm QM}\text{ requires cyclic }N\text{-vacuum Hamiltonians in both hierarchies,}\
&\quad \text{nearest-neighbour fractional tunnelling }K e^{-S_I/N}e^{-i\theta/N},
