\noindent\textbf{Derivation.}
From (P3) and (P4), every defining clause of $\Sigma_{\rm QM}$ in (P1) is satisfied:
\begin{align}
(P3)\wedge(P4)&\Longrightarrow o_{\rm QM}\in\Sigma_{\rm QM}. && \text{conjunction of the two QM bridge results}
