By the definition of a Cartesian product of success sets,
\begin{align}
o_{\rm QM}\in\Sigma_{\rm QM}\text{ and }o_{\rm 2d}\in\Sigma_{\rm 2d}
&\Longrightarrow (o_{\rm QM},o_{\rm 2d})\in\Sigma_{\rm QM}\times\Sigma_{\rm 2d}. && \text{product membership}
